              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts inquired whether the respondents were obligated to meet the injunction standards for the elements of the injunction that fell short of remand to the agency."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad593954159f-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg questioned whether a simple vacatur of the deregulation decision\u2014making Roundup Ready alfalfa a regulated article again\u2014would be sufficient."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad593954159f-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether the alleged harm to organic farming alone was sufficient to justify an injunction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad593954159f-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 56,
              "start": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito posed a question to counsel regarding Mr. Robbins\u2019 arguments."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad593954159f-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts thanked counsel and noted that the case was submitted."
