              "pages": {
                "end": 15,
                "start": 15
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Stewart, petitioners argue that the Court should decide the case rather than defer to the ongoing EIS process."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-ad593954159f-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 38,
                "start": 38
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Petitioners contend that the district court\u2019s vacatur had the effect of undoing the deregulation of Roundup Ready alfalfa."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Garre",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-ad593954159f-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 56,
                "start": 56
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Garre, counsel for the petitioners argues that the injunction is unlawful and is causing immediate harm to farmers."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Garre",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ad593954159f4c645054c9f816055b126286c8819af862be25e8322338302ae4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-ad593954159f-0003-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 57,
                "start": 57
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Garre, counsel further asserts that there is no evidence of cross\u2011pollination with hay and that the alleged harm is merely psychological objection to genetically engineered alfalfa."
        }
